            "review_title": "Review at Xóm Chợ Củ - Món Ngon Xứ Quảng",
            "review_text": "Robert B\nPrague, Czech Republic43 contributions\n0\nNice lovely place and food.\nFeb 2023 • Couples\nIt is calm and friendly place, where you can eat light and delicious food. You sit in the 1.st floor and can watch from the beautiful balcony the rush on the street or you can hide from noise inside. \nThe food was colourful and delicious and the staff was very friendly and nice. The prices are compared to other restaurants around reasonable and little lower. \nLovely place.\nRead more\nWritten February 27, 2023",
